<title>POLAND: ELEKTROMONTAZ-W NET RISES IN JUNE.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROMONTAZ-W NET RISES IN JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.34 vs   0.13</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.50 vs   0.19</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.44 vs   0.18</p>
<p> Sales		    5.99 vs   3.98</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.41 vs   1.15</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.07 vs   1.69</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.42 vs   1.62</p>
<p> Sales		   29.05 vs  22.90</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Elektromontaz Warszawa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
